  "question": {
    "text": "<p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>, the equilibrium constant is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></math> for the reaction:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cu</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8652;</mo><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Ag</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>The equilibrium constant for the reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>Ag</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8652;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>Cu</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&nbsp;is ______. (Round off the answer to the nearest integer)</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cu</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8652;</mo><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Ag</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>Ag</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8652;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>Cu</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>The equilibrium reaction is reversed and multiplied with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>,</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>eq</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>20</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>20</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mn>20</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>236</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8771;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
